{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14103340","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1410334001:1":{"text":"안녕하세요, 헬라 부인, 혹시 오늘 호건 장군님을 보셨나요?","source_cn":"你好，海拉女士，请问你今天是否见过霍根将军？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE58779D0723F6FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410334002:1":{"text":"당신들은... 아, 생각났다! 레오프론에서 온 특사들이군요! 같이 있는 것 아니었나요? 그렇다면 전 더더욱 알 리가 없죠!","source_cn":"你们——哦，想起来了！耀光来的使节大人们！你们没有在一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF996CCF4BA4A4255","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410334003:1":{"text":"그런 건 플린한테 물어보도록 해요! 전 일에만 관심이 있으니까요!","source_cn":"这种事得去问弗林！我只关心工作！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AEEDCE7322D104F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1410334003":{"text":"그런 건 플린한테 물어보도록 해요! 전 일에만 관심이 있으니까요!","source_cn":"这种事得去问弗林！我只关心工作！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AEEDCE7322D104F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410334004:1":{"text":"마을 아니면 광산에 있을 거예요...","source_cn":"不是在村里就是在矿洞里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACFC508A09345AED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410334005:1":{"text":"광산에 있으면 좋겠네요. 깊은바위 수정의 공급 부족 문제를 빨리 처리해야 할 테니까요!","source_cn":"我倒希望他在矿洞里，他是该抓紧处理深岩晶供应不足的问题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x385AC1B9CD8CC7B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410334006:1":{"text":"제련소의 용광로가 헛돌아서는 안 돼요. 아직 처리하지 못한 주문서가 산처럼 쌓여있다고요!","source_cn":"冶炼所的熔炉可不能空转，我们的订单已经堆积了好大一批！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE294A00F1F672535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410334007:1":{"text":"신용! 우리 드워프가 자랑스럽게 여기는 건, 기술뿐 아니라, 신용도 있답니다!","source_cn":"信誉！我们矮人引以为豪的可不只是工艺，还有信誉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568B773FFF29E028","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"플린은 어디에 있지?","source_cn":"弗林在哪？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x747DF5BF5517D508","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"플린은 어디에 있지?","female":"플린은 어디에 있지?","variant_male_record_index":"71402","variant_female_record_index":"71403","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:负责人海拉":{"text":"책임자 헬라","source":"负责人海拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}